OL,3,GNEWSAHow facial recognition is being
OL,4,Aused to fight crime in Bradford
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt's a weekday morning in Bradford and
OL,7,Fa police van is pulling up in a busy
OL,8,Fpedestrian area on Market Street.
OL,10,FThere are no flashing lights or sirens
OL,11,F- just the familiar blue and yellow
OL,12,Fmarkings and a dark camera mounted high
OL,13,Fon the roof.
OL,15,FShoppers weave around it and nobody
OL,16,Fappears to pay much attention, even
OL,17,Fafter signs are put out warning that
OL,18,Flive facial recognition technology is
OL,19,Fin use.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
