OL,3,GNEWSAHow facial recognition is being
OL,4,Aused to fight crime in Bradford
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor the people walking through the city
OL,7,Fit's an ordinary day, but inside the
OL,8,Fvan a bank of screens displays the
OL,9,Ffaces passing by, comparing them in
OL,10,Freal time with a police watchlist.
